{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちまりか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/19/3649175/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼ゆみ姉にケーキあーん♡／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/19/3649175/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ソファーで寝てるところ\n隠し撮りしようとしたら\n気づいてるらしくにやつくゆみ姉"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/19/3649175/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/19/3649175/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気づいてるのに寝たふりとかー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/19/3649175/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日の乃木どこで\n4thアンダー曲「春のメロディー」\nちょっと流れました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フルで公式にアップされましたが...\nチェックはしましたか:D？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今学校の体育でダンスを\nやってるんだけど、\n今日はグループごとに発表する日！\nその中で代表を決めるんだけども..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんと私の入ってるグループが\n代表に選ばれたー！びっくりだわ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな頑張ろうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/19/3649175/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/19/3649175/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/19/3649175/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンスって楽しいね^^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/19/3649175/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりにななせと撮った♡\n動森買ってメンバーと\n通信したいなぁ。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/19/3649175/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そろそろテストの日が\n近づいてきた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/19/3649175/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/19/3649175/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また絶賛テスト勉強中になります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/19/3649175/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/19/3649175/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}